				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Useful files\n\n```text\nconfig/bvc/bvc_defaults\n```\n\nProject configuration.\n\n```text\n<bvc repo>/config/bvc/bvc_defaults\n```\n\nToolkit defaults.\n\n```text\ndevkit/pharo-local/lepiter/gt4gemstone.properties\n```\n\nGenerated GT GemStone connectors.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
