					"uidString": "Ut38JRVET+KKOaCr75rkmQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Useful commands\n\n```sh\nbvc help\nbvc list\nregistryReport.solo --registry=bvc\ngslist.solo -lc\n```\n\nUse bvc first. Drop lower only when you need the underlying detail.\n"
